<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="30394423"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="951419310"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="In Your Wake (feat. Jeza) (Original Mix)"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Said The Sky / ILLENIUM"/><amll:meta key="album" value="In Your Wake (feat. Jeza)"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="05:07.110"><div begin="00:13.170" end="05:07.110"><p begin="00:13.170" end="00:27.690" itunes:key="L1">Oh, oh</p><p begin="00:27.690" end="00:29.480" itunes:key="L2">Losing ourselves<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们迷失了自我</span></p><p begin="00:29.480" end="00:34.420" itunes:key="L3">And we're barely standing (Standing)</p><p begin="00:34.420" end="00:37.620" itunes:key="L4">Warm body surround<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">被温暖的身躯所包裹</span></p><p begin="00:37.620" end="00:42.280" itunes:key="L5">If there's no soft landing<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果结局并不温和</span></p><p begin="00:42.280" end="00:55.080" itunes:key="L6">Oh, oh</p><p begin="00:55.080" end="01:01.400" itunes:key="L7">Let me be forgotten<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就让我被遗忘</span></p><p begin="01:01.400" end="01:08.510" itunes:key="L8">Just leave me in your wake<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就让我被你离弃</span></p><p begin="01:08.510" end="01:12.060" itunes:key="L9">I never know the bottom of my heart<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我从未了解自己的心底深处</span></p><p begin="01:12.060" end="01:15.540" itunes:key="L10">I never read a caution from the start<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我从未理解最初的告诫</span></p><p begin="01:15.540" end="01:25.060" itunes:key="L11">Now we may forgotten the truth to start again<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如今或许我们只有忘掉真相，再得以重新开始</span></p><p begin="01:36.460" end="01:54.020" itunes:key="L12">Oh, oh</p><p begin="01:56.720" end="02:08.040" itunes:key="L13">Let me be forgotten<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我被遗忘</span></p><p begin="02:13.950" end="02:29.850" itunes:key="L14">Leave me in your wake<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我被你遗弃</span></p><p begin="02:29.850" end="02:30.290" itunes:key="L15">In your wake</p><p begin="02:30.290" end="02:30.670" itunes:key="L16">In your wake</p><p begin="02:30.670" end="02:34.940" itunes:key="L17">In your wake</p><p begin="02:44.460" end="02:47.970" itunes:key="L18">Confusions surround<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">被困惑包围</span></p><p begin="02:47.970" end="02:51.360" itunes:key="L19">There's no understanding<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一无所解</span></p><p begin="02:51.360" end="02:54.820" itunes:key="L20">When we're feeling down<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当我们失意时</span></p><p begin="02:54.820" end="02:58.510" itunes:key="L21">We're living stranded<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们活在困境中</span></p><p begin="02:58.510" end="03:11.950" itunes:key="L22">Oh, oh</p><p begin="03:11.950" end="03:15.440" itunes:key="L23">I never know the bottom of my heart<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我从未了解自己的心底深处</span></p><p begin="03:15.440" end="03:19.080" itunes:key="L24">I never read a caution from the start<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我从未理解最初的告诫</span></p><p begin="03:19.080" end="03:26.890" itunes:key="L25">Now we may forgotten the truth to start again<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如今我们只有忘掉真相，再得以重新开始</span></p><p begin="03:39.450" end="03:42.990" itunes:key="L26">I never know the bottom of my heart<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我从未了解自己的心底深处</span></p><p begin="03:42.990" end="03:46.420" itunes:key="L27">I never read a caution from the start<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我从未理解最初的告诫</span></p><p begin="03:46.420" end="03:54.590" itunes:key="L28">Now we may forgotten the truth to start again<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如今我们只有忘掉真相，再得以重新开始</span></p><p begin="04:00.280" end="04:07.030" itunes:key="L29">Let me be forgotten<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我被遗忘</span></p><p begin="04:07.030" end="04:26.780" itunes:key="L30">Leave me in your wake<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我被你遗弃</span></p><p begin="04:26.780" end="04:30.950" itunes:key="L31">In your wake<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在你醒来之后</span></p><p begin="04:30.950" end="04:41.330" itunes:key="L32">In your wake</p><p begin="04:41.330" end="04:47.780" itunes:key="L33">Let me be forgotten<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我被遗忘</span></p><p begin="04:47.780" end="04:54.980" itunes:key="L34">Just leave me in your wake<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我被你离弃</span></p><p begin="04:54.980" end="04:59.150" itunes:key="L35">I never know the bottom of my heart<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我从未了解自己的心底深处</span></p><p begin="04:59.150" end="05:01.860" itunes:key="L36">I never read a caution from the start<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我从未理解最初的告诫</span></p><p begin="05:01.860" end="05:07.110" itunes:key="L37">Now we may forgotten the truth to start again<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如今我们只有忘掉真相，再得以重新开始</span></p></div></body></tt>